@startuml sequence_02_kegiatan
title Sequence Diagram - Kegiatan Harian & Logbook

actor "Peserta\n(Mahasiswa/Siswa)" as Peserta
boundary "Halaman Web" as UI
control "LogbookController" as Ctrl
entity "Database" as DB
actor "Pembimbing\nLapangan" as PL

Peserta -> UI : Isi form logbook harian (teks & foto)
UI -> Ctrl : POST /logbookku/save
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Ctrl : Validasi data & Upload foto
Ctrl -> DB : Simpan data logbook (status 'pending')
activate DB
DB --> Ctrl : Success
deactivate DB
Ctrl --> UI : Redirect dengan pesan sukses
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> Peserta : Tampilkan logbook baru di tabel

== Validasi oleh Pembimbing Lapangan ==
PL -> UI : Lihat daftar logbook siswa binaan
UI -> Ctrl : GET /logbook/siswa/{id}
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> DB : Ambil data logbook siswa
activate DB
DB --> Ctrl : Data logbook
deactivate DB
Ctrl --> UI : Tampilkan detail logbook
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> PL : Menampilkan data logbook

PL -> UI : Klik "Approve" (Setujui) Logbook
UI -> Ctrl : POST /logbook/approve
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> DB : Update status logbook menjadi 'approved'
activate DB
DB --> Ctrl : Success
deactivate DB
Ctrl --> UI : Response JSON / Redirect
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> PL : Status logbook berubah menjadi disetujui

@enduml
